### FAIL: Update app user - that doesn't belong to club
PUT {{base_url}}/api/club/app-users/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token_club_user}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan",
  "last_name": "Perez",
